_neg h), neg_divInt_neg]\n  split\n  · next h => rw [mk_eq_divInt, Int.natAbs_of_nonneg (Int.le_of_lt h)]\n  · next h₁ h₂ =>\n    apply (num_divInt_den _).symm.trans\n    simp [Int.le_antisymm (Int.not_lt.1 h₂) (Int.not_lt.1 h₁)]","start":462,"end":471},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}